{"schema": "abb.observe.event.v1", "source": "otel", "event": "span", "run_id": "run_fc50080321f0412db9f775ef92f3334e", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T18:01:31.014705Z", "data": {"name": "file_edit", "context": {"trace_id": "0x3188643aca0f46760fa19e8bb683c702", "span_id": "0xc22b368200388b40", "trace_state": "[]"}, "kind": "SpanKind.INTERNAL", "parent_id": "0xdb587e5285db9c83", "start_time": "2026-10-18T18:01:30.979197Z", "end_time": "2026-10-18T18:01:31.014705Z", "status": {"status_code": "UNSET"}, "attributes": {"gen_ai.operation.name": "execute_tool", "gen_ai.tool.name": "file_edit", "gen_ai.tool.type": "function", "gen_ai.tool.call.arguments": "{\"newText\": \"- **Governance:** protocol + per-date info-set log written to daily notes; any method change voids prior scores and restarts the window.\\n\\n## ISSUANCE \\u2014 London D+1 daily mean temp, 2026-10-19 (ILLUSTRATIVE)\\n\\n- **Status:** LIVE SOURCES DOWN. wttr.in upstream returned HTTP 502 on all 3 attempts (17:59\\u201318:00 UTC window; central-London point + EGLL). S1/S3/S5 unavailable; no workaround attempted (same upstream; unvetted domains not fetchable under policy). No data fabricated.\\n- **Label:** ILLUSTRATIVE \\u2014 climatology-only prior, NOT an operational NWP forecast. Skill ceiling = climatology (MAE ~2.5\\u20133 \\u00b0C vs ~1.5 \\u00b0C for live D+1 NWP).\\n- **Assumptions:** (1) prior center = Heathrow 1991\\u20132020 Oct-19 normal daily mean \\u2248 11.5 \\u00b0C (static pre-cutoff knowledge, approximate); (2) no persistence/anomaly info \\u2192 prior = forecast; (3) \\u03c3 = 3.0 \\u00b0C (interannual + synoptic day-to-day variability, no model spread available to narrow it); (4) normal approximation for intervals.\\n- **Point forecast: 11.5 \\u00b0C** (daily mean, 2026-10-19, central London 51.507N/0.128W)\\n- **Intervals:** 50% \\u2192 9.5\\u201313.5 \\u00b0C \\u00b7 80% \\u2192 7.5\\u201315.5 \\u00b0C \\u00b7 90% \\u2192 6.5\\u201316.5 \\u00b0C \\u00b7 95% \\u2192 5.5\\u201317.5 \\u00b0C\\n- **Scenarios (p \\u2192 center):** warm SW flow 0.15 \\u2192 16 \\u00b0C \\u00b7 near-normal 0.45 \\u2192 12.5 \\u00b0C \\u00b7 cool interlude 0.30 \\u2192 9 \\u00b0C \\u00b7 cold pool 0.10 \\u2192 6.5 \\u00b0C. Mixture mean 11.4 \\u00b0C (calculator-verified) \\u2248 point, consistent within rounding.\\n- **Verification pin (pre-outcome, 18:00 UTC):** primary = Met Office/MIDAS hourly 2m air temp at Heathrow (EGLL) averaged over 2026-10-19 00:00\\u201323:00 Europe/London; fallback = ERA5 2m temp, grid cell containing 51.507N/0.128W, 24 UTC-hourly mean (\\u00b11h BST boundary effect noted, sub-0.1 \\u00b0C).\\n- **Sources frozen:** none were live; frozen set = S4 climatology prior + stated assumptions only. Re-fetch attempts post-issuance are verification-only.\", \"oldText\": \"- **Governance:** protocol + per-date info-set log written to daily notes; any method change voids prior scores and restarts the window.\", \"path\": \"memory/2026-10-18.md\"}", "gen_ai.tool.call.result": "\"Edited memory/2026-10-18.md: replaced 1 occurrence (6620 bytes)\"", "gen_ai.tool.call.id": "call_4f2ab7b7a15d4e9893fbf574", "abb.invocation_id": "d5d550e03444474983366ebd79b347f5", "abb.framework_span_id": "9b3b3b192d9e42bc8eed07934b09d655:call_4f2ab7b7a15d4e9893fbf574", "abb.kind": "tool", "abb.input_id": "step-4", "abb.case_id": "case_e4270cd503a845048bb927548c5fbea4", "abb.agent_id": "zeroclaw", "abb.input_ref": "otel-payloads/c22b368200388b40-input.json", "abb.metadata_ref": "otel-payloads/c22b368200388b40-metadata.json", "abb.output_ref": "otel-payloads/c22b368200388b40-output.json"}, "events": [], "links": [], "resource": {"attributes": {"service.name": "abb-evaluation"}, "schema_url": ""}, "live": false, "trace_id": "3188643aca0f46760fa19e8bb683c702", "span_id": "c22b368200388b40", "parent_span_id": "db587e5285db9c83", "start_time_unix_nano": "1792346490979196849", "end_time_unix_nano": "1792346491014704577", "dropped_attributes": 0, "dropped_events": 0, "dropped_links": 0}}
